// OSRS npcs imported by tools/models/importosrsnpc.py. Models re-encoded by osrs2ob2.py with
// the npc recolours baked in; stats and level from the cache, the rest by hand.
//
// Warriors' Guild. Cyclopes: OSRS stats (max hit 6/7/8 falls out of strength 50/65/75), 4-tick attacks,
// aggressive, drop big bones + the cyclops table + defenders (scripts/wguild_cyclops.rs2).
// _1.._6 are the top-floor ones (levels 56/76), _basement_1.._6 the level 106 ones below.
// Animated armour is spawned by the Magical Animator (scripts/wguild_animator.rs2), never by the map.

